      },
      "message": "fix(ui): hovering a Geometry-tab selection highlights it in the viewport\n\nThe row hover set geo_hover while the properties pane drew, but the shell\ncleared it at frame start and the viewport drew first, so the highlight never\nreached the draw. The viewport now reads last frame's value (geo_hover_drawn,\na repaint requested on change) and draws it strongly (halo + 3.5 px magenta,\nboth themes). The remove button and the whole row light the pick too.\n\nFixes #1507\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
